# Images to replace

Put your own photographs here. Keep these file names so the pages do not break:

- `flag-pakistan.svg` — already included
- `allama-iqbal.jpg` — portrait for the LEFT side of the home banner
- `quaid-e-azam.jpg` — portrait for the RIGHT side of the home banner
- `hero-flag.jpg` — wide photo of the flag or Minar-e-Pakistan for the dark hero background
- `punjab.jpg` `sindh.jpg` `kpk.jpg` `balochistan.jpg` `ict.jpg` `ajk.jpg` `gb.jpg` — province cards
- `villages/` — one photo per village, for example `rawalpindi-sura.jpg`

Use clear daylight photos. Do not upload pictures of children without family permission.
Create a simple coloured placeholder if a photo is missing so the layout does not look broken.
